@HrAuth.WebApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5284

### Login — authenticate and receive a JWT pair
POST {{HrAuth.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "your-username",
  "password": "your-password"
}

### Refresh token — exchange the pair for a fresh one
POST {{HrAuth.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/auth/refresh-token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN",
  "refreshToken": "PASTE_REFRESH_TOKEN"
}

### Validate token — check whether a bearer token is still accepted
POST {{HrAuth.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/auth/validate-token
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN

### Absences (D33) — a page of the Sep-2026 payroll period (16-Aug..15-Sep), men
GET {{HrAuth.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/absences?payMonth=2026-09&gender=M&pageNumber=1&pageSize=25
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN

### Absences — one employee over an explicit range, without synthesized days
GET {{HrAuth.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/absences?from=2026-09-01&to=2026-09-15&employeeId=00000163&includeSynthesized=false
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN

### Absence rates — all SmartHCM grades (add ?positionId=118 for one position's grades)
GET {{HrAuth.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/absence-rates/grades
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN

### Absence rates — all positions with their allowed grades
GET {{HrAuth.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/absence-rates/positions?includeInactive=false
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN

### Absence rates — attendance periods with monthly / daily rate
GET {{HrAuth.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/absence-rates/periods
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN
